Forster Cain was the founder of [[Org/Prime Meridian/index|Prime Meridian]] and its first Archmechanic. Before the Org had [[Phenomena/Hearts|Hearts]] to coordinate the trains, he was wired through magic to sensors all across the city and piloted every train from a single center. He built the first rail system in a deal with [[Geography/Calaria/index|Calaria]]'s then-king, and later declared the dissolution of royal rule in a joint announcement with the [[Org/Iridescent Church/index|Iridescent Church]], founding the Council that rules Calaria now.
